      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.26.70",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.26.70",
      "verse": 70,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he denied before ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all, saying, I know not what thou sayest.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.26.71",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.26.71",
      "verse": 71,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when he had gone out into the porch, another ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "maid",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " saw him, and said to them that were there, This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " was also with Jesus of Nazareth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.26.72",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.26.72",
      "verse": 72,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And again he denied with an oath, I do not know the man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.26.73",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.26.73",
      "verse": 73,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And after a while came to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they that stood by, and said to Peter, Surely thou also art ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of them; for thy speech betrayeth thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.26.74",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.26.74",
      "verse": 74,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then began he to curse and to swear, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", I know not the man. And immediately the cock crowed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MAT.26.75",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:MAT.26.75",
      "verse": 75,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Peter remembered the word of Jesus, who said to him, Before the cock shall crow, thou wilt deny me thrice. And he went out, and wept bitterly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
